Hello everybody<br><br>I’ve been fiddling around with the radio to try and find outwhat causes the “silent DMR” and “helicoptering” sound issues.<br><br>This is the TL;DR:<ul><li>Simplex transmissions do not have that problem. Setting your hotspot to simplex will <strong class="text-strong">fix</strong> the problem.</li></ul><ul><li>The issue seems to be rooted in the way OpenGD77 handles TimeSlots, and there are some wacky glitches you can reliably reproduce.</li></ul>I posted details, explanations and anecdotal evidence over here: <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=19&amp;t=5001&amp;start=20#p37673" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=19&amp;t=5001&amp;start=20#p37673</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6012">EA4IAU</a> — Mon Jul 07, 2025 10:25 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
