Hello everyone.<br><br>I have been redirected here from the test version thread, where they discussed this "helicoptering and Silent DMR" issue.<br>Tried some of the things there, (hotspot config and some other stuff) and did not work.<br><br>What it DID work regarding "Silent DMR", was to set Options &gt; Sound Options &gt; Prompt to "Beep". (I usually have it on No Keys)<br>Moreover, by setting it up to "Silent" it made the problem WAY worse. So much so that not even PPTing or opening the squelch via SK2-hold would do nothing to turn on the sound.<br><br>It did nothing for the "helicoptering DMR" though. I still have the issue in which the first frame of the transmission gets repeated like "rRRRRRRR". PTTing or opening the squelch takes it out of that hiccup. I'd understand that the two issues have different causes.<br><br>Is there any test I can do?<br><br>73<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6012">EA4IAU</a> — Wed May 28, 2025 7:58 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
